        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor A as Administrador\n    \n    box rgb(240, 248, 255) Frontend (React Native)\n        participant VS as ExportReportScreen\n        participant H as useExport\n        participant MF as ExportManager\n        participant VO_F as ExportVO\n    end\n    \n    box rgb(255, 240, 245) Backend (Spring Boot)\n        participant R as ExportRouter\n        participant C as ExportController\n        participant SB as ExportService\n        participant VO_B as ExportVO\n        participant DB as MySQL\n    end\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;VS: Selecciona formato (CSV, XLSX, PDF, GeoJSON, Imagen), filtros y autorización\n    VS-&gt;&gt;H: exportReport(filters, format, authAuthorization)\n    H-&gt;&gt;MF: requestExport(filters, format, authAuthorization)\n    MF-&gt;&gt;VO_F: new ExportVO(filters, format, adminId, auth)\n    VO_F--&gt;&gt;MF: retorna vo\n    MF-&gt;&gt;R: POST /api/v1/reports/export (vo JSON)\n    \n    R-&gt;&gt;C: exportData(req, res)\n    C-&gt;&gt;VO_B: new ExportVO(req.body)\n    VO_B--&gt;&gt;C: retorna vo\n    C-&gt;&gt;SB: processExport(vo)\n    \n    SB-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT reportes aplicando filtros\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SB: Retorna registros\n    SB-&gt;&gt;SB: Anonimiza datos personales y aproxima ubicaciones (salvo autorización formal)\n    SB-&gt;&gt;SB: Genera archivo en formato solicitado (CSV/XLSX/PDF/GeoJSON/Imagen)\n    \n    SB-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO bitacora (admin_id, accion, formato)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SB: Insert OK\n    \n    SB--&gt;&gt;C: Archivo / Stream de exportación\n    C--&gt;&gt;R: return ResponseEntity.ok(file)\n    R--&gt;&gt;MF: HTTP 200 OK (Archivo)\n    MF--&gt;&gt;H: return file\n    H--&gt;&gt;VS: update UI State\n    VS--&gt;&gt;A: Descarga archivo y muestra \&quot;Exportación exitosa y registrada en bitácora\&quot;&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="i091WBVmqOoEOZD57WqC-1">
